1
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:14,333
Quit showing off, Hajime!

2
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:22,875
Trying to kill me, Miyuki?!

3
00:00:23,625 --> 00:00:24,791
Sorry!

4
00:00:24,791 --> 00:00:27,625
Still as close as ever, I see.

5
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:29,625
Chris!

6
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:36,083
What are you doing on this boat?!

7
00:00:36,083 --> 00:00:37,875
With respect, Mr. Kindaichi...

8
00:00:37,875 --> 00:00:41,291
The treasure on that island
belonged to my ancestors!

9
00:00:42,791 --> 00:00:44,791
I won't lose to you this
time, Mr. Kindaichi!

10
00:00:44,791 --> 00:00:46,666
I'll be the one to find the treasure!

11
00:00:46,666 --> 00:00:48,416
Hihou Island's hidden treasure...

12
00:00:48,416 --> 00:00:52,333
Hihou Island... Wonder
how Koichiro's doing.

13
00:00:52,333 --> 00:00:55,541
Kindaichi... Aren't we there yet?

14
00:00:57,166 --> 00:00:59,041
You all right, Inspector Kenmochi?

15
00:00:59,041 --> 00:01:00,833
Just drank a bit too much last night.

16
00:01:02,416 --> 00:01:05,250
Come to think of it, where's Itsuki?

17
00:01:05,916 --> 00:01:08,958
That reporter? He was up
to something in his cabin.

18
00:01:09,625 --> 00:01:14,000
October 14. We're bound for Hihou
Island across the Hyuga Sea.

19
00:01:15,916 --> 00:01:18,541
The seasickness is awful,
but this is my job.

20
00:01:19,250 --> 00:01:23,208
I'm finally going to meet
Mitsusada Hazuki. Can't wait!

21
00:01:24,041 --> 00:01:26,875
Back on Hihou Island...

22
00:01:34,583 --> 00:01:35,750
Well, I ended up coming here again!

23
00:01:36,583 --> 00:01:37,791
Hihou Island!

24
00:01:58,708 --> 00:02:01,041
Hajime, you're hopeless!

25
00:02:01,583 --> 00:02:04,416
What on earth have you
packed in all those bags?!

26
00:02:04,416 --> 00:02:06,416
You've got your hands full, Hajime.

27
00:02:08,625 --> 00:02:11,458
A woman needs all sorts
of things, you know.

28
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:17,250
My Hat!
